# Cabin: key ReplaceCabinPublicKeyAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA=

[wireguard]
interface: listen 51820, address 10.100.0.2/16
peer Barn at 10.100.0.4: key ReplaceBarnPublicKeyAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA=, allowed [10.100.0.4/32, 192.168.4.0/24], routed, endpoint 203.0.113.30:51820, psk
peer Home at 10.100.0.1: key ReplaceHomePublicKeyAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA=, allowed [10.100.0.1/32, 192.168.10.0/24, 192.168.1.0/24, 10.100.10.0/24], routed, endpoint 203.0.113.10:51820, psk
peer Lake at 10.100.0.3: key ReplaceLakePublicKeyAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA=, allowed [10.100.0.3/32, 192.168.3.0/24], routed, psk
peer Phone at 10.100.0.100: key ReplacePhonePublicKeyAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA=, allowed [10.100.0.100/32], psk

[firewall]
mesh zone: input drop, output accept, forward drop
ping 10.100.0.2 from [Barn 10.100.0.4, Home 10.100.0.1, Lake 10.100.0.3, Phone 10.100.0.100]
listen port: wan udp/51820
accept in Cabin dns: tcp+udp/53 from mesh [10.100.0.1/32, 192.168.1.1/32, 192.168.10.1/32] to the node [10.100.0.2/32, 192.168.2.1/32]
accept in Cabin.camera rtsp: tcp/554 from mesh [10.100.0.100/32, 192.168.1.50/32] to lan [192.168.2.30/32]
accept in Cabin.weather http via Home: tcp/80 from mesh [10.100.0.1/32] to lan [192.168.2.40/32]
otherwise drop: between [mesh, lan], and from mesh to any zone

[dhcp]
lease Cabin.camera: 192.168.2.30 for [aa:bb:cc:00:00:04]
lease Cabin.weather: 192.168.2.40 for [aa:bb:cc:00:00:06]
